np
9ed14135fae7b24b3cc769112dcce32d: basically, use &lt;section&gt; for anything where you would feel ok giving a section title (&lt;h1&gt;) and including that section title in a table of contents
9ed14135fae7b24b3cc769112dcce32d: and use &lt;div&gt; if the only reason you have the element is styling or scripting
69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: does &lt;article&gt;/&lt;hgroup&gt;/something start a new heading level like &lt;section&gt; does?
